---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Cookie Policy - Learn SAP Free" 
  description="Review the cookie policy for Learn SAP Free, covering how cookies are used for analytics, functionality, and Google AdSense."
>
  <section class="bg-canvas py-[80px] min-h-[60vh] ">
    <div class="max-w-[760px] mx-auto px-4">
      
      <!-- Back Link -->
      <a href="/" class="text-link font-caption-strong text-[14px] inline-flex items-center gap-1 mb-8 hover:text-primary-focus transition-colors">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 stroke-current fill-none stroke-[2]" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <line x1="19" y1="12" x2="5" y2="12"></line>
          <polyline points="12 19 5 12 12 5"></polyline>
        </svg>
        Back to Dashboard
      </a>

      <!-- Page Header -->
      <header class="border-b border-hairline pb-6 mb-8">
        <span class="text-primary font-caption-strong text-[13px] uppercase tracking-wider block mb-2">Legal Information</span>
        <h1 class="font-display-lg text-[32px] md:text-[40px] text-ink leading-tight tracking-tight">Cookie Policy</h1>
        <p class="font-fine-print text-ink-muted-48 mt-2">
          Effective Date: June 14, 2026 &nbsp;|&nbsp; Last Updated: June 14, 2026 &nbsp;|&nbsp; learnsapfree.com
        </p>
      </header>

      <!-- Content -->
      <div class="rich-text">
        <p>
          Cookies are small text files that are stored on your device when you visit a website. They help websites remember your preferences, understand how you use the site, and deliver relevant content.
        </p>

        <h2>What Cookies We Use</h2>

        <h3>1. Essential Cookies</h3>
        <p>
          These are required for the website to function properly. They enable basic features like page navigation and access to secure areas. The website cannot function correctly without these cookies.
        </p>

        <h3>2. Analytics Cookies</h3>
        <p>
          We use Google Analytics to understand how visitors interact with our website. These cookies collect information such as which pages you visit, how long you spend on them, and how you arrived at our site. All data is anonymous and aggregated.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Provider:</strong> Google Analytics<br />
          <strong>Purpose:</strong> Website traffic analysis and performance monitoring<br />
          <strong>Data Collected:</strong> Page views, session duration, device type, approximate location (country/city level), referral source
        </p>

        <h3>3. Advertising Cookies (Google AdSense)</h3>
        <p>
          We use Google AdSense to display advertisements on our website. Google may use cookies to show you ads based on your previous visits to this site and other sites on the internet.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Provider:</strong> Google AdSense<br />
          <strong>Purpose:</strong> Displaying relevant advertisements<br />
          <strong>Data Collected:</strong> Browsing behaviour, interests, device information
        </p>
        <p>
          You can opt out of personalised advertising by visiting <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link">Google's Ad Settings</a>.
        </p>

        <h3>4. Functionality Cookies</h3>
        <p>
          These cookies remember your preferences such as your chosen quiz progress or newsletter subscription status to improve your experience on the site.
        </p>

        <h2>Third-Party Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          Some cookies on our site are placed by third-party services. We do not control these cookies. Please refer to the respective privacy policies of these third parties:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Google Analytics:</strong> <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link">https://policies.google.com/privacy</a></li>
          <li><strong>Google AdSense:</strong> <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link">https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads</a></li>
          <li><strong>YouTube (embedded videos):</strong> <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link">https://policies.google.com/privacy</a></li>
        </ul>

        <h2>How to Manage Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          You can control and manage cookies in several ways:
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Browser Settings:</strong> Most browsers allow you to block or delete cookies through their settings menu. Here are links to cookie management guides for popular browsers:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="https://support.google.com/chrome/answer/95647" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link">Google Chrome</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/enable-and-disable-cookies-website-preferences" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link">Mozilla Firefox</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-edge/delete-cookies-in-microsoft-edge" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link">Microsoft Edge</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://support.apple.com/en-in/guide/safari/sfri11471/mac" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link">Safari</a></li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          <strong>Note:</strong> Disabling certain cookies may affect how the website functions. Essential cookies cannot be disabled as they are required for the site to operate.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to This Cookie Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this Cookie Policy from time to time to reflect changes in technology, law, or our services. Any updates will be posted on this page with a revised effective date. We encourage you to review this page periodically.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions about our use of cookies, please contact us:
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@learnsapfree.com" class="text-link">support@learnsapfree.com</a><br />
          <strong>Website:</strong> learnsapfree.com<br />
          <strong>Contact Page:</strong> <a href="https://learnsapfree.com/contact" class="text-link">https://learnsapfree.com/contact</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
